{
  "_README": {
    "what": "One entry per matrix unit (USPS state code, 50 states + DC). Every unit is the same adapter: ONE per-state FileGDB zip from the USGS TNM staged-products bucket, read in place via /vsizip/ (never unzipped on the runner).",
    "url_pattern": "https://prd-tnm.s3.amazonaws.com/StagedProducts/Tran/GDB/TRAN_{State_Name_With_Underscores}_State_GDB.zip — filenames are UNVERSIONED; zip_bytes/last_modified below are the 2026-02-12 vintage (bucket listing verified 2026-08-16) and exist only for the QA size band + drift visibility. A refreshed upstream zip is expected to change them.",
    "layers": "Trans_RoadSegment (roads) + Trans_TrailSegment (trails); EPSG:4269 Measured MultiLineString; layer names + field schemas verified identical across AK/DE/VT/WY 2026-08-16.",
    "golden_bbox": "optional [w,s,e,n]; when present qa_roads_tnm.py compares per-class counts inside the bbox against the live carto.nationalmap.gov transportation MapServer (layers 29-37). Only units whose bbox lies entirely inside the state carry one.",
    "license": "US Government public domain (usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0); attribution 'USGS The National Map: National Transportation Dataset; U.S. Census Bureau – TIGER/Line; U.S. Forest Service.'"
  },
